{"id":"6cf31091f58bf0b5","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-program-numbering.md","title":"A Fixed Effective Program Numbering","display":"df-program-numbering — A Fixed Effective Program Numbering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-program-numbering","aliases":["57-df-program-numbering"],"display":"df-program-numbering — A Fixed Effective Program Numbering","depends_on":["[[57-df-encoding]]","[[57-df-turing-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-program-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-program-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-program-numbering — A Fixed Effective Program Numbering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"20d4e2ccede99498\" href=\"?note=20d4e2ccede99498\" title=\"57-df-turing-machine\">57-df-turing-machine</a>，数值串及二元配对编码取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a>。指令列码按键 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle q,a\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\langle q,a\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 严格递增排序；指令的五个字段依次为状态、读符号、下一状态、写符号、移动量加一。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；所有自然数都作为程序索引，非法表码映射到没有转移、不会停机的空表。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选机器图；Prog 的参数次序为索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>、机器图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Instr}(u)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{slen}(u)=5\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,0)\\ne1\\land\n\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\le2\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,3)\\le2\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,4)\\le2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Instr}(u)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{slen}(u)=5\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,0)\\ne1\\land\n\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\le2\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,3)\\le2\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,4)\\le2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{key}(u)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,0),\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{key}(u)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,0),\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProgCode}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\n[\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;\\operatorname{Instr}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))]\\land\n[\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;\\operatorname{key}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))&lt;\\operatorname{key}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,j))]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProgCode}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\n[\\forall i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;\\operatorname{Instr}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))]\\land\n[\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;\\operatorname{key}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))&lt;\\operatorname{key}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,j))]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_e\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,0),\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,2),\\operatorname{sget}(u,3),\\operatorname{sget}(u,4)-1\\rangle\\rangle:\n\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;(u=\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))\\}&amp;e\\in\\operatorname{ProgCode},\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;e\\notin\\operatorname{ProgCode}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_e\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,0),\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,2),\\operatorname{sget}(u,3),\\operatorname{sget}(u,4)-1\\rangle\\rangle:\n\\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;(u=\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))\\}&amp;e\\in\\operatorname{ProgCode},\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;e\\notin\\operatorname{ProgCode}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(M_e\\in\\mathrm{TM}),\\qquad\\{M_e:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{TM},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prog}(e,M)\\leftrightarrow(e\\in\\mathbb N\\land M=M_e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(M_e\\in\\mathrm{TM}),\\qquad\\{M_e:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{TM},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prog}(e,M)\\leftrightarrow(e\\in\\mathbb N\\land M=M_e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>编号来自显式有限转移表，不以“任取一个可接受编号”代替构造。后续正规形条目给出它与递归函数闭包及有效参数化的对应。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"20d4e2ccede99498","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]，数值串及二元配对编码取 [[57-df-encoding]]。指令列码按键 $\\langle q,a\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}$ 严格递增排序；指令的五个字段依次为状态、读符号、下一状态、写符号、移动量加一。$e,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；所有自然数都作为程序索引，非法表码映射到没有转移、不会停机的空表。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]，数值串及二元配对编码取 [[57-df-encoding]]。指令列码按键 $\\langle q,a\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}$ 严格递增排序；指令的五个字段依次为状态、读符号、下一状态、写符号、移动量加一。$e,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；所有自然数都作为程序索引，非法表码映射到没有转移、不会停机的空表。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle q,a\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"e,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Instr}(u)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{slen}(u)=5\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,0)\\ne1\\land\n\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\le2\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,3)\\le2\\land\\operatorname{sget}(u,4)\\le2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{key}(u)\\coloneqq\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,0),\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProgCode}\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\n[\\forall i<\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;\\operatorname{Instr}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))]\\land\n[\\forall i<j<\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;\\operatorname{key}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))<\\operatorname{key}(\\operatorname{sget}(e,j))]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M_e\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,0),\\operatorname{sget}(u,1)\\rangle,\n\\langle\\operatorname{sget}(u,2),\\operatorname{sget}(u,3),\\operatorname{sget}(u,4)-1\\rangle\\rangle:\n\\exists i<\\operatorname{slen}(e)\\;(u=\\operatorname{sget}(e,i))\\}&e\\in\\operatorname{ProgCode},\\\\\n\\varnothing&e\\notin\\operatorname{ProgCode}.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(M_e\\in\\mathrm{TM}),\\qquad\\{M_e:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{TM},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Prog}(e,M)\\leftrightarrow(e\\in\\mathbb N\\land M=M_e).","display":true}],"bytes":2124,"backlinks":[{"id":"446d13f76de9da28","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_n$。数值函数图及 $\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\mathrm{Rec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，$\\mathrm{PR}_n$ 取 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。编号、输入和输出严格取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]、[[57-df-encoding]]、[[57-df-machine-coding]]；$T_n$ 取 [[57-df-t-predicate]]；相对可计算性取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]]。$\\Psi_e^{(n)}$ 为下式定义的机器部分函数图，不使用尚未定义的 φₑ。$\\chi_{T_n}$ 是平坦输入 $(e,x_1,\\ldots,x_n,s)$ 上的总特征函数。"},{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$；$D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n,\\operatorname{unpack}_n$ 取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。固定 [[57-df-program-numbering]] 的程序编号、[[57-df-t-predicate]] 的实际停机历史关系 $T_n$ 及 [[57-df-machine-coding]] 的总输出提取函数 $U$；不更换编号。$\\mathrm{PartRec}_n$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]，该编号的正规形和有效参数化性质取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。$\\varphi_e^{(n)}$ 为部分函数图，$\\varphi_e$ 默认为一元实例；多元调用使用同一打包映射。停机与部分值相等取 [[57-df-halt-notation]]。$\\mu s\\,T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 是下式的谓词见证搜索，只在存在历史时定义；不将广义部分函数搜索与普通集合最小元混淆，参见 [[57-df-minimum-operator]]、[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]。"},{"id":"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$。$D_n$ 及打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$M_e$ 取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{Word}_n$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U$ 取 [[57-df-machine-coding]]；$\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 使用该固定编号和该固定输入表示。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-subtraction-function]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["b2e96ed477b7b031","20d4e2ccede99498"]}